  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "이런 곳에서 실력이 뛰어나 보이는\n트레이너를 만나다니, 운이 좋은걸!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B7F00020ACF3C5D0C11C0020C2E4B825C7740020B6F0C5B4B0980020BCF4C774B294000AD2B8B808C774B108B97C0020B9CCB098B2E4B2C8002C0020C6B4C7740020C88BC740AC78002100100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...아니, 오히려 그 반대인가?\n지금 문제가 좀 있어서 말이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002EC544B2C8002C0020C624D788B8240020ADF80020BC18B300C778AC00003F000AC9C0AE080020BB38C81CAC000020C8800020C788C5B4C11C0020B9D0C774C57C002E00100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지하 수도의 파이프가 막혀 버렸대.\n커다란 포켓몬 때문이라나 봐.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0D5580020C218B3C4C7580020D30CC774D504AC000020B9C9D6000020BC84B838B300002E000ACEE4B2E4B7800020D3ECCF13BAAC0020B54CBB38C774B77CB0980020BD10002E00100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "커다란 만큼 만만한 상대가 아닐 거야.\n그러니 너의 활약을 기대하고 있을게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEE4B2E4B7800020B9CCD07C0020B9CCB9CCD55C0020C0C1B300AC000020C544B2D00020AC70C57C002E000AADF8B7ECB2C80020B108C7580020D65CC57DC7440020AE30B300D558ACE00020C788C744AC8C002100100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너의 지도에 포켓몬이 있을 법한 장소의\n좌표를 보내 줄 테니까<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n가이드로 설정해서 조사해 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108C7580020C9C0B3C4C5D00020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020C788C7440020BC95D55C0020C7A5C18CC758000AC88CD45CB97C0020BCF4B0B40020C9040020D14CB2C8AE4C00100001BE00000AAC00C774B4DCB85C0020C124C815D574C11C0020C870C0ACD5740020C918002E00100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너의 지도에 좌표를 보내 줄 테니까\n가이드로 설정해서 조사해 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108C7580020C9C0B3C4C5D00020C88CD45CB97C0020BCF4B0B40020C9040020D14CB2C8AE4C000AAC00C774B4DCB85C0020C124C815D574C11C0020C870C0ACD5740020C918002E00100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 어써러셔가\n파이프에 끼어 있다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C5B4C368B7ECC154AC00000AD30CC774D504C5D00020B07CC5B40020C788B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬의 기술로 충격을 주면\n파이프에서 꺼낼 수 있을 것 같다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7580020AE30C220B85C0020CDA9ACA9C7440020C8FCBA74000AD30CC774D504C5D0C11C0020AEBCB0BC0020C2180020C788C7440020AC830020AC19B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어써러셔는\n영문도 모른 채 날뛰기 시작했다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C368B7ECC154B294000AC601BB38B3C40020BAA8B9780020CC440020B0A0B6F0AE300020C2DCC791D588B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "러쎠!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B7ECC3A0002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬의 반응이 사라져서 와 봤는데...\n뭐야 이 녀석은!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7580020BC18C751C7740020C0ACB77CC838C11C0020C6400020BD24B294B370002E002E002E000ABB50C57C0020C7740020B140C11DC7400021003F00100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어써러셔라는 포켓몬이라고?\n정말 커다란 포켓몬이네!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C368B7ECC154B77CB2940020D3ECCF13BAACC774B77CACE0003F000AC815B9D00020CEE4B2E4B7800020D3ECCF13BAACC774B124002100100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "셔어...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C154C5B4002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사과하는 거야? 신경 쓰지 않아도 돼!\n들어가 보고 싶었던 거지? 말 안 해도 알아!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACACFCD558B2940020AC70C57C003F0020C2E0ACBD0020C4F0C9C00020C54AC544B3C40020B3FC0021000AB4E4C5B4AC000020BCF4ACE00020C2F6C5C8B3580020AC70C9C0003F0020B9D00020C5480020D574B3C40020C54CC544002100100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너, 괜찮다면\n내 파트너가 되어 주지 않을래?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108002C0020AD1CCC2EB2E4BA74000AB0B40020D30CD2B8B108AC000020B418C5B40020C8FCC9C00020C54AC744B798003F00100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지하 수도에는 포켓몬들이 많이 사니까\n네가 있으면 나도 안심이 될 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0D5580020C218B3C4C5D0B2940020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7740020B9CEC7740020C0ACB2C8AE4C000AB124AC000020C788C73CBA740020B098B3C40020C548C2ECC7740020B4200020AC70C57C002E00100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "러쎠!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B7ECC3A0002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너도 괜찮은 모양이구나!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108B3C40020AD1CCC2EC7400020BAA8C591C774AD6CB098002100100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어써러셔를 구해 줘서 고마워!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C368B7ECC154B97C0020AD6CD5740020C918C11C0020ACE0B9C8C6CC002100100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아, 어써러셔!\n바로 현장으로 가 보자!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC544002C0020C5B4C368B7ECC1540021000ABC14B85C0020D604C7A5C73CB85C0020AC000020BCF4C790002100100002011401C50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
